  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Norkumsgath is truly a jewel amongst planets, and we are proud to call it our homeworld. This is where our civilization started and remains the seat of our political power. Its vast oceans cover about 78% of the planets surface. Most cities and our capital Thela is located on the ocean floor, where our origin is.",
    "value": "诺库姆斯加斯无愧为行星中的瑰宝，我们自豪地称其为家园。这里是文明的起点，至今仍是政治权力的中心。其广阔的海洋覆盖了约78%的星球表面，多数城市及首都塞拉皆建于海底，我们的起源之地。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The ocean floor is illuminated because of bioluminescent vegetation and strange and beautiful sea life. The ocean is also heated by black smokers, heating the ocean floor up to 42 C as an average temperature. This water temperature has given rise to some particularly hardy creatures.",
    "value": "海底因发光植被与奇美海洋生物而熠熠生辉，黑烟囱热泉也为海洋加温，使海底平均温度高达42摄氏度。这样的水温孕育出格外坚韧的生命形态。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "The surface landscape is heavily covered with rainforests, leading towards inland deserts on the largest landmasses. Both beneath the waves and on land await the bastions of our society, teeming with billions of our kind.",
    "value": "地表则密布热带雨林，延伸至大陆内部形成沙漠。无论浪涛之下或陆地之上，皆矗立着我们社会的堡垒，栖息着数十亿同胞。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Unusually, Norkumgsgath does not possess any seasons at all due to a unique rotation and orbit that ensures both sides of the world are always equally exposed to numerous factors. Its moon, Thetala, functions primarily as a spaceport and military factory with a tidal-locked surface so reflective that it acts like a second sun.",
    "value": "诺库姆斯加斯尤为独特之处在于全无四季，特殊的自转与公转轨道使星球两面始终均衡暴露于各类宇宙因素中。其卫星特塔拉主要作为太空港与军事工厂，潮汐锁定的表面反射极强，宛若第二颗太阳。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "Our homeworld is the most heavily guarded world in the entire League, surpassing even Vulis, our greatest fortress world. Experimental antimatter cannons are stationed in orbit as well as on the surface, that rips any cruiser in half in a matter of seconds. Though none are dumb enough to attack our homeworld, we are always prepared. Ever vigilant.",
    "value": "作为联盟中戒备最森严的世界，诺库姆斯加斯的防御甚至超越了我们最强大的要塞星球乌利斯。轨道与地表部署的实验性反物质炮，可在数秒内将任何巡洋舰撕裂。虽无蠢徒敢进犯家园，我们始终严阵以待，永远警惕。"
  }
]